  speakerName: Jom
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d01af24494056374182e13118c0585e2, type: 3}
  dialogueText: 'No adda mangilawlawag iti maysa a banag ken kayatmo nga ibaga nga
    naawatam, mabalinmo nga agusar iti ''maawatan ko.''


    Kayatna a saoen ti
    ''I understand.''


    Denggem a naimbag: maawatan ko.


    Ita, padasem nga
    ibagam ti ''maawatan ko'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'When someone explains something and you want to tell them that
    you understand, you can use ''maawatan ko.''

    It means ''I understand.''

    Now,
    try saying ''mawatan ko'' yourself.'
